{
  "name": "WF-05 - Website Evidence Research",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "WF-05 \u2014 WEBSITE/EVIDENCE RESEARCH\n\nTRIGGER: After WF-04 (status still CLEANED, now enriched)\nINPUT: companies row (website, socials)\nPROCESSING: Calls the Python API's /wf05/research endpoint (python/research/ai_extractor.py) \u2014 fetches public pages, extracts evidence via prompts/researcher.md, validates provenance in code before writing anything\nOUTPUT: research + research_evidence rows, status=RESEARCHED\nDB OPS: Insert research, insert research_evidence (multiple rows)\nERROR PATH: Zero evidence found -> status still advances to RESEARCHED but flagged low-quality in error_log; scores near 0 on personalization component per docs/06 \u00a72.5\n\nSetup: point every Supabase node's credential at your project, and set\nExecute Command nodes' working directory to the repo root (needs\n`pip install -r python/requirements.txt` done first, and SUPABASE_URL /\nSUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY / GEMINI_API_KEY / GROQ_API_KEY set as\nenvironment variables n8n can see).",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 420
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -680,
        -120
      ],
      "id": "sticky-note-header",
      "name": "Workflow Contract (docs/13-n8n-architecture.md)"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "*/30 * * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -420,
        80
      ],
      "id": "trigger",
      "name": "Every 30 min"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "row",
        "operation": "getAll",
        "tableId": "companies",
        "returnAll": true,
        "filterType": "manual",
        "matchType": "allFilters",
        "notesInFlow": "Filter: status = 'CLEANED'"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -160,
        80
      ],
      "id": "get_cleaned",
      "name": "Get enriched CLEANED companies",
      "credentials": {
        "supabaseApi": {
          "id": "SUPABASE_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Hooze Supabase"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 1,
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        80,
        80
      ],
      "id": "Loop Over Rows",
      "name": "Loop Over Rows"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.PYTHON_API_URL }}/wf05/research",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "X-Internal-Secret",
              "value": "={{ $env.PYTHON_API_SECRET }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "Content-Type",
              "value": "application/json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={\n  \"company_id\": \"{{ $json.id }}\"\n}"
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        320,
        0
      ],
      "id": "run_research",
      "name": "Run ai_extractor.py (WF-05)",
      "continueOnFail": true,
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
